[32m+[m[32m-- Safe owner-scoped helper; it exposes only the caller's device state.[m
[32m+[m[32mcreate or replace function public.security_list_devices()[m
[32m+[m[32mreturns table ([m
[32m+[m[32m  id uuid,[m
[32m+[m[32m  device_id text,[m
[32m+[m[32m  label text,[m
[32m+[m[32m  platform text,[m
[32m+[m[32m  fingerprint text,[m
[32m+[m[32m  trusted boolean,[m
