[32m+[m[32m-- Replace the permissive Story policy with an actual audience check.[m
[32m+[m[32mdrop policy if exists stories_read on public.stories;[m
[32m+[m[32mcreate policy stories_read[m
[32m+[m[32mon public.stories[m
[32m+[m[32mfor select to authenticated[m
[32m+[m[32musing ([m
[32m+[m[32m  deleted_at is null[m
